      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are in a place of absolute despair, and the weight of everything feels unbearable. If you're feeling like ending things is the only way to take control, please know that there are people who want to support you. You can connect with compassionate and trained individuals by calling or texting 988 anytime in the US and Canada. In the UK, you can call 111. These services are free, confidential, and available 24/7.",
